  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Demonstrating disease pressure reduction through probiotic usage in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Two Dutch companies Noble Bioproducts B.V. and Tiptopp Aquaculture B.V. will demonstrate their probiotic solutions as natural alternatives to antibiotics in the aquaculture sector in Indonesia.Through demonstrations across the complete production cycle, it will be proved that probiotics reduce disease pressure, improve fish health outcomes, and combat antimicrobial resistance (AMR) in commercial tilapia systems.</narrative>
  </description>
